    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3510690/extras/d69b419654c13fb20aa94f0b8d7bc619.poster.avif?t=1751555159\" width=800 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3510690/extras/d69b419654c13fb20aa94f0b8d7bc619.webm?t=1751555159\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3510690/extras/d69b419654c13fb20aa94f0b8d7bc619.mp4?t=1751555159\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wild Shot: Animal Saviour \u2013\u00a0Protect, Rescue, and Defend the Wild!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the world of\u00a0<strong>Wild Shot: Animal Saviour</strong>, a vibrant and action-packed sniper adventure where you take on hunters and free captured animals. Set in a lush, living jungle, every shot you take helps restore balance to nature. With colorful landscapes, dynamic challenges, and creative gameplay, it\u2019s a rescue mission like no other!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3510690/extras/840f3ff1b124816a179263ae6d0e8d67.poster.avif?t=1751555159\" width=800 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3510690/extras/840f3ff1b124816a179263ae6d0e8d67.webm?t=1751555159\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3510690/extras/840f3ff1b124816a179263ae6d0e8d67.mp4?t=1751555159\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rescue, Explore, Protect</strong><br>The jungle is full of surprises - hidden traps, roaming hunters, and clever distractions designed to slow you down. Equipped with a sniper rifle, RPGs, and tranquilizer darts, you'll navigate thick forests, misty swamps, and sunlit clearings to outsmart poachers and free the animals. But stay sharp - some hunters set fake animals as decoys, while others use smoke grenades to cover their tracks!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3510690/extras/fd767d363a7998f32232f5712a8f9285.poster.avif?t=1751555159\" width=800 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3510690/extras/fd767d363a7998f32232f5712a8f9285.webm?t=1751555159\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3510690/extras/fd767d363a7998f32232f5712a8f9285.mp4?t=1751555159\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ever-Changing Challenges</strong><br>No two missions are the same! Some levels take you deep into dense forests, while others lead you to wide-open savannas or mysterious caves. Day and night cycles keep things exciting, affecting visibility and enemy movement. Keep an eye out for moving vehicles transporting captured animals - hit the right target to stop them in their tracks!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3510690/extras/c46e3371fd023473c6b1f56e2f1ff6e6.poster.avif?t=1751555159\" width=800 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3510690/extras/c46e3371fd023473c6b1f56e2f1ff6e6.webm?t=1751555159\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3510690/extras/c46e3371fd023473c6b1f56e2f1ff6e6.mp4?t=1751555159\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Creative and Fun Gameplay</strong><br>Precision sniping, clever traps, and interactive environments make every level unique. Shoot open supply crates for bonus ammo, use tranquilizer darts to have animals fight back, and set off explosive chain reactions by targeting hidden TNT. Unlock power-ups, rescue rare species, and discover fun surprises as you progress.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3510690/extras/276a50b36aa50b8faee7022e4be5c08a.poster.avif?t=1751555159\" width=800 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3510690/extras/276a50b36aa50b8faee7022e4be5c08a.webm?t=1751555159\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3510690/extras/276a50b36aa50b8faee7022e4be5c08a.mp4?t=1751555159\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Jungle Waiting for a Hero</strong><br>More than just a sniper game, Wild Shot: Animal Saviour is an adventure filled with heart and strategy. Its mission is to protect nature. Plan your approach, free the animals, and take down poachers in the most creative ways possible. Are you ready to embark on this wild rescue mission?<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3510690/extras/214f31dda54cba71500588291d3204a2.poster.avif?t=1751555159\" width=800 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3510690/extras/214f31dda54cba71500588291d3204a2.webm?t=1751555159\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3510690/extras/214f31dda54cba71500588291d3204a2.mp4?t=1751555159\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Battle for the Wild</strong><br>The fate of the captured animals is in your hands. Plan your attacks, outsmart the hunters, and prove that one skilled shooter can make a difference in the fight for wildlife. So, ready to take the shot? Your mission is clear: eliminate the poachers, outsmart their deadly tactics, and set the animals free. Do you have what it takes to be the ultimate saviour of the wild? The hunt begins now!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3510690/extras/d69b419654c13fb20aa94f0b8d7bc619.poster.avif?t=1751555159\" width=800 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3510690/extras/d69b419654c13fb20aa94f0b8d7bc619.webm?t=1751555159\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3510690/extras/d69b419654c13fb20aa94f0b8d7bc619.mp4?t=1751555159\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wild Shot: Animal Saviour \u2013\u00a0Protect, Rescue, and Defend the Wild!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the world of\u00a0<strong>Wild Shot: Animal Saviour</strong>, a vibrant and action-packed sniper adventure where you take on hunters and free captured animals. Set in a lush, living jungle, every shot you take helps restore balance to nature. With colorful landscapes, dynamic challenges, and creative gameplay, it\u2019s a rescue mission like no other!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3510690/extras/840f3ff1b124816a179263ae6d0e8d67.poster.avif?t=1751555159\" width=800 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3510690/extras/840f3ff1b124816a179263ae6d0e8d67.webm?t=1751555159\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3510690/extras/840f3ff1b124816a179263ae6d0e8d67.mp4?t=1751555159\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rescue, Explore, Protect</strong><br>The jungle is full of surprises - hidden traps, roaming hunters, and clever distractions designed to slow you down. Equipped with a sniper rifle, RPGs, and tranquilizer darts, you'll navigate thick forests, misty swamps, and sunlit clearings to outsmart poachers and free the animals. But stay sharp - some hunters set fake animals as decoys, while others use smoke grenades to cover their tracks!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3510690/extras/fd767d363a7998f32232f5712a8f9285.poster.avif?t=1751555159\" width=800 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3510690/extras/fd767d363a7998f32232f5712a8f9285.webm?t=1751555159\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3510690/extras/fd767d363a7998f32232f5712a8f9285.mp4?t=1751555159\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ever-Changing Challenges</strong><br>No two missions are the same! Some levels take you deep into dense forests, while others lead you to wide-open savannas or mysterious caves. Day and night cycles keep things exciting, affecting visibility and enemy movement. Keep an eye out for moving vehicles transporting captured animals - hit the right target to stop them in their tracks!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3510690/extras/c46e3371fd023473c6b1f56e2f1ff6e6.poster.avif?t=1751555159\" width=800 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3510690/extras/c46e3371fd023473c6b1f56e2f1ff6e6.webm?t=1751555159\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3510690/extras/c46e3371fd023473c6b1f56e2f1ff6e6.mp4?t=1751555159\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Creative and Fun Gameplay</strong><br>Precision sniping, clever traps, and interactive environments make every level unique. Shoot open supply crates for bonus ammo, use tranquilizer darts to have animals fight back, and set off explosive chain reactions by targeting hidden TNT. Unlock power-ups, rescue rare species, and discover fun surprises as you progress.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3510690/extras/276a50b36aa50b8faee7022e4be5c08a.poster.avif?t=1751555159\" width=800 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3510690/extras/276a50b36aa50b8faee7022e4be5c08a.webm?t=1751555159\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3510690/extras/276a50b36aa50b8faee7022e4be5c08a.mp4?t=1751555159\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Jungle Waiting for a Hero</strong><br>More than just a sniper game, Wild Shot: Animal Saviour is an adventure filled with heart and strategy. Its mission is to protect nature. Plan your approach, free the animals, and take down poachers in the most creative ways possible. Are you ready to embark on this wild rescue mission?<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3510690/extras/214f31dda54cba71500588291d3204a2.poster.avif?t=1751555159\" width=800 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3510690/extras/214f31dda54cba71500588291d3204a2.webm?t=1751555159\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3510690/extras/214f31dda54cba71500588291d3204a2.mp4?t=1751555159\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Battle for the Wild</strong><br>The fate of the captured animals is in your hands. Plan your attacks, outsmart the hunters, and prove that one skilled shooter can make a difference in the fight for wildlife. So, ready to take the shot? Your mission is clear: eliminate the poachers, outsmart their deadly tactics, and set the animals free. Do you have what it takes to be the ultimate saviour of the wild? The hunt begins now!</p>",
